{{Quote|I have a camtono of Beskar waiting for you upon the delivery of the asset.|"The Client," to "the Mandalorian"|audio=Client-camtono.flac|<ref name="Chapter 1" />}}
During the [[New Republic Era|era]] of the [[New Republic]]<ref name="Chapter 1" /> in [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> a [[Gideon's Imperial remnant|remnant]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] hired the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Din Djarin]] to undertake a '''mission''' to [[Arvala-7]] in order to recover a [[bounty]] for the "[[the Client]]" only referred to as "[[Din Grogu|the asset]]" in exchange for a large shipment of [[Beskar]].<ref name="Chapter 1" />

